  "notes": "FadedCore 0.4.0 RC1 is now supported through independently pinned helper 0.4.0. Update this installer, refresh Schedule I and install/update the runtime with the game closed. Includes the matching SDK preview, signed minimum-runtime and PNG/WAV/mesh support, and a complete preview-backup migration guide. The same catalog URL serves compatible entries to old/new clients. Existing PZ/PZF3D tools, settings and all six editions are preserved. Runtime upgrades retain existing mod selections; new examples do not activate automatically. Requires Windows x64, supported game build and exact .NET Runtime10.0.12. Multiplayer unverified; performance partial. No first standalone gameplay mod is included yet.",
